+<title>RUSTSEC-2026-0596: Vulnerability in etherparse</title>
+<id>https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0596.html</id>
+<updated>2026-11-24T12:00:00+00:00</updated>
+<category term="memory-exposure"/>
+<category term="denial-of-service"/>
+<link href="https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0596.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="RUSTSEC-2026-0596: Vulnerability in etherparse"/>
+<published>2026-11-24T12:00:00+00:00</published>
+<summary xml:lang="en">Out-of-bounds read when iterating over IPv6 extension headers of laxly parsed packets</summary>
+<content xml:lang="en" type="html">
+<article>
+<span class="floating-menu">
+<a href="https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db/commits/main/crates/etherparse/RUSTSEC-2026-0596.md">History</a> ⋅
